":11,"text":"And now you are cursed from the ground, which has opened its mouth to receive your brother’s blood from your hand.","tok":[{"t":"And now you are "},{"t":"cursed","s":["H0779"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from the ground, which has "},{"t":"opened","s":["H6475"],"a":[6]},{"t":" its "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"receive","s":["H3947"],"a":[9]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"brother’s","s":["H0251"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[11]},{"t":" from your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"When you till the ground, it will no longer yield its strength to you. You will be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth.","tok":[{"t":"When","s":["H3588"],"a":[0]},{"t":" you "},{"t":"till","s":["H5647"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0127"],"a":[3]},{"t":", it will no longer "},{"t":"yield","s":["H5414"],"a":[6]},{"t":" its "},{"t":"strength","s":["H3581"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to you. You will be a "},{"t":"fugitive","s":["H5128"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and a "},{"t":"wanderer","s":["H5110"],"a":[10]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And Cain said to Jehovah, My punishment is greater than I can bear.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Cain","s":["H7014"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", My "},{"t":"punishment","s":["H5771"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"greater","s":["H1419"],"a":[4]},{"t":" than I can "},{"t":"bear","s":["H5375"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Now You have driven me out this day from the face of the ground, and from Your face I will be hidden; and I will be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth, and whoever finds me will kill me.","tok":[{"t":"Now You have driven me "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[1]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"face","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0127"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and "},